  "body": "Welcome to Maka Terrace, tucked away in a lovely, quiet and safe pocket of Millwater, surrounded by quality homes and with no through traffic. It's the sort of neighbourhood where you're generally only driving through if you live here or are visiting, offering a wonderful setting for family life.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Universal Homes approximately six years ago, this modern, well-presented home offers 207m² of comfortable living, with four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms and two separate lounges. There's plenty of room for everyone to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nAnd those three bathrooms are a real bonus! With a fourth bedroom and bathroom downstairs, there's fantastic flexibility for teenagers, guests or extended family wanting a little independence. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite includes a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and its very own balcony. The perfect little escape when you need five minutes to yourself with a morning coffee or an evening wine.\r\n\r\nThe main living level offers two separate lounge areas, while a step down into the kitchen and dining space creates a lovely sense of separation without losing that connection. A designer kitchen with breakfast bar sits at the heart of the home, and a handy office nook provides a practical spot for working from home.\r\n\r\nOutside, two covered entertaining areas at either end of the home give you options for relaxing or hosting friends, whatever the weather. The fully fenced, 530m² freehold section provides plenty of room for children and pets, without creating unnecessary maintenance.\r\n\r\nAnd here's a real bonus! The current owners have installed a lockable gate down the side of the home, creating a secure grassed area where you can store the boat, caravan or trailer. Add to that a double internal-access garage with separate entrances and additional off-street parking, and there's plenty of room for all the family's vehicles and toys.\r\n\r\nLocation is another big tick. You're on the doorstep of Te Ara Tahuna, the beautiful loop walkway and cycleway around the Orewa Estuary, perfect for morning walks, bike rides or simply getting out and enjoying the surroundings. Kingsway School and other excellent local schools are within walking distance, with Metro Park, shops and cafés nearby.\r\n\r\nOrewa Beach and township are just a short drive away, while both northbound and southbound motorway access are only minutes from home, making everyday commuting wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nModern, spacious and wonderfully versatile, with a quiet setting, excellent parking and a location that puts so much within easy reach.\r\n\r\nCome along to one of our open homes or get in touch to arrange a private viewing. We'd love to show you through!\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5UZG",
